What AI Cannot Replace in Railway Safety
There is a temptation to describe AI as if it can independently manage safety.

That is not how responsible EHS technology should be implemented.

AI cannot replace:

Competent railway safety professionals
Field inspections
Worker consultation
Engineering judgment
Investigation interviews
Operational knowledge
Emergency leadership
Management accountability
AI can process information and identify patterns.

People provide context, verification and judgment.

That human-AI partnership is particularly important in safety-critical railway environments.

